WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.341
Unit thirteen. Using the Toilet!

2
00:00:04.305 --> 00:00:07.845
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.895 --> 00:00:11.464
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.514 --> 00:00:15.265
Today we learn about Using the Toilet. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.168 --> 00:00:19.468
Toilet. Say it with me. Toilet!

6
00:00:22.999 --> 00:00:26.432
Flush. Say it with me. Flush!

7
00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:32.949
Soap. Say it with me. Soap!

8
00:00:36.452 --> 00:00:39.802
Water. Say it with me. Water!

9
00:00:43.285 --> 00:00:46.452
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

10
00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:53.400
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

11
00:00:56.909 --> 00:01:00.093
Germs. Say it with me. Germs!

12
00:01:03.576 --> 00:01:06.926
Hands. Say it with me. Hands!

13
00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:20.078
After I use the toilet, I flush it and wash my hands with soap and water. Clean hands stop germs from spreading. I keep the toilet clean for the next person.

14
00:01:20.128 --> 00:01:21.398
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.867 --> 00:01:28.008
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.058 --> 00:01:29.208
Soap!

17
00:01:30.009 --> 00:01:35.137
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.187 --> 00:01:36.337
Germs!

19
00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:44.546
Did you know? Washing hands with soap after using the toilet is one of the best ways to stop tummy illness!

20
00:01:44.596 --> 00:01:46.686
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.426 --> 00:01:55.770
Think and answer. What must you always do after using the toilet?

22
00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:56.970
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.028 --> 00:02:02.948
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.998 --> 00:02:05.632
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

